@startuml
title SplitSmart Application Architecture
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

actor Member

package "Browser" {
  [SplitSmart dashboard] as UI
  [Selected group preference\n(localStorage)] as Preference
  [Balance projection] as Balance
}

package "Next.js application" {
  package "Route handlers" {
    [Groups API\nGET / POST] as GroupsAPI
    [Group detail API\nGET] as DetailAPI
    [Members API\nPOST] as MembersAPI
    [Expenses API\nPOST + validation + split] as ExpensesAPI
  }
  [Prisma Client] as Prisma
}

database "SQLite\nprototype/prisma/dev.db" as DB

Member --> UI : manage groups and expenses
UI --> Preference : remember selected group
UI --> GroupsAPI : list / create groups
UI --> DetailAPI : load group and ledger
UI --> MembersAPI : add member
UI --> ExpensesAPI : record expense
DetailAPI --> Prisma
GroupsAPI --> Prisma
MembersAPI --> Prisma
ExpensesAPI --> Prisma
Prisma --> DB : read / write SplitSmart tables
UI --> Balance : sum payer amounts - shares

note right of DB
  SplitSmart uses dedicated tables:
  SplitSmartGroup
  SplitSmartMember
  SplitSmartExpense
  SplitSmartShare

  Existing Lab 8 tables remain separate.
end note
@enduml